.cursor/
.cursorrules
.aider*
.github/copilot-instructions.md

# Secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.key
keystore/

# Foundry
contracts/out/
contracts/cache/
contracts/broadcast/
!contracts/broadcast/**/run-latest.json
# lib is committed as git submodules, the Foundry convention. Verified: with lib
